    ],
    "text": "(b) by the repeal of paragraph (d) thereof, and the substitution therefor of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.68,
      122.59,
      549.19,
      148.06
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(d) All commissioned officers shall retire on reaching the age of Fifty-five (55) years or on completion of a period of Twenty (20) years of service.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
